[{"title":"七十自寿八首 其六","author":"张洵佳","text":"飞电传来字数行，彭宣有意起安昌。\n催臣上道官书急，乞病还山席帽凉。\n早虑铜驼卧荆棘，可怜尘海变沧桑。\n晨星寥落知音少，往事缠绵未忍忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18058,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七十自寿八首 其七","author":"张洵佳","text":"长庆风流绝妙辞，高吟惯被室人嗤。\n泉明归去才编集，表圣功勋祇重诗。\n掌故五朝资阅历，书香七代庆留遗。\n惟将忠厚存馀地，付与儿孙好护持。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18059,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七十自寿八首 其八","author":"张洵佳","text":"梁园宾客散如云，幸有徐陵起殿军。\n跌宕京华如昨日，沈沦沧海感离群。\n风霜刻骨寒能耐，松柏凌冬日未曛。\n拟乞寿言仍自寿，白头忍再累夫君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18060,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题谢孝子侍疾图","author":"张洵佳","text":"霜天晓角寒灯擎，鸡栖腷膊声将鸣。\n孝子侍疾忘旦暮，遽然梦醒神魂惊。\n茶铛药灶床前列，珍馐供奉馨且洁。\n当作亲闱健在身，承欢舞綵相怡悦。\n寒往暑来岁屡迁，沈疴难疗苦绵延。\n全凭一点精诚意，挽住颓阳十八年。\n迄今事久沧桑变，里闾孝行犹争羡。\n难得荆关好画工，传神特与开生面。\n潘岳家风著述详，吉人有后善收藏。\n江流不改图长在，通德门庭世泽长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18061,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赵焕文茂才殉节纪二首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"衰季难将节义论，伊谁誓死戒儿孙。\n一衿冷落沧江畔，也有心肝奉至尊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18062,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赵焕文茂才殉节纪二首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"想到中天禅让时，皋夔依旧列丹墀。\n末流忽变唐虞世，可惜先生未及知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18063,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题琴川倪问渔采乐园","author":"张洵佳","text":"石磴茅亭迤逦开，烟霞深处即蓬莱。\n松关秋老霏红叶，竹径云荒破绿苔。\n名重缓和称国手，人随刘阮到天台。\n苍生近苦疮痍甚，何日山中肯出来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18064,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓发","author":"张洵佳","text":"犬吠柴门过客船，半轮红日吐前川。\n霜鏖树老峰争出，风挟帆飞浪不圆。\n几处村鸡犹唱晓，一群野鸭共冲烟。\n龙砂此去无多路，笑听乡音水驿边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18065,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"风狂雨暴雪霜联，人事难知欲问天。\n百难尽经惟欠死，不堪回首溯从前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18066,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"甲子纪元度岁朝，椿年未老望春凋。\n五更惨向床前诀，遥指青天气寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18067,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其三","author":"张洵佳","text":"青阳惨澹不成春，慈竹旋枯二月辰。\n陟岵遥瞻方陨涕，那堪陟屺又伤神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18068,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其四","author":"张洵佳","text":"四壁萧条絮缕空，附棺无具附身同。\n邻家借得黄棉袄，泣伴单衾殉殡宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18069,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其五","author":"张洵佳","text":"昆池捲起劫灰烟，顷刻漫空不见天。\n从此公私涂炭尽，死亡患难一身全。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18070,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其六","author":"张洵佳","text":"头蓬足跣泪滂沱，虮虱攒身疾病多。\n似此红羊罹浩劫，九原父母痛如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18071,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其七","author":"张洵佳","text":"杏花开过又桃花，愁里光阴一月赊。\n闻道故乡烽火熄，病魂先已闯回家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18072,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其八","author":"张洵佳","text":"信宿迁延始至家，一人相见一咨嗟。\n谁知大阮飘零苦，得庆生还病转加。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18073,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其九","author":"张洵佳","text":"大劫才离大疫临，寒灯彻夜听呻吟。\n庭前赖有婆娑树，风雨黄昏又暗侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18074,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十","author":"张洵佳","text":"龙蛇入梦鵩哀鸣，劫火烧残大厦倾。\n从此生机惊断绝，阖门老幼尽吞声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18075,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十一","author":"张洵佳","text":"一波未静一波生，又听堂前哭泣声。\n托钵天涯归计阻，哀音递到泪如倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18076,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十二","author":"张洵佳","text":"斜阳暗淡下秋林，霜雪旋将绿叶侵。\n杜老还乡思弟妹，清词宛转付哀吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18077,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十三","author":"张洵佳","text":"红蕖翠筱正葱茏，一夜风狂陨折空。\n我若呼天天亦泣，祖孙四代半年中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18078,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十四","author":"张洵佳","text":"凄雨酸风彻夜听，累累五柩寄中庭。\n衰门更有惊心事，子姓僝然尽白丁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18079,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十五","author":"张洵佳","text":"觑破人情冷暖中，欲将隐恨诉苍穹。\n试看寂寂空庭里，谁念遗徽吊晚风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18080,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十六","author":"张洵佳","text":"乞米空回剩饭箩，西江何处润微波。\n寒衣窃取穷人料，抵作绨袍受惠多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18081,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"历劫吟 其十七","author":"张洵佳","text":"往事回头思不穷，嗟予遭际有谁同。\n兰成身世沧桑感，尽在江南一赋中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18082,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中口占 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"劳劳车马悔风尘，况复风尘抱病身。\n梦里不知身是客，喃喃犹唤枕边人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18083,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中口占 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"茶烟药火绕藜床，日夕奚僮侍奉忙。\n疾痛声声呼父母，人穷然后见天良。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18084,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中口占 其三","author":"张洵佳","text":"楼头少妇刻相思，一样心情两地驰。\n寄语南归新燕子，客中辛苦为瞒之。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18085,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"步月","author":"张洵佳","text":"三千里外息征鞍，客里情怀强自宽。\n祗有关山今夜月，又教儿女忆长安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18086,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"燕郊览古二首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"四塞河山百尺台，茫茫千载我重来。\n一杯酒酹燕昭墓，愿借黄金惜壮才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18087,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"燕郊览古二首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"燕市黄尘十丈高，重重锁钥控神皋。\n南朝王气今安在，剩有江声咽暮涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18088,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泊舟七里江八游金山口占","author":"张洵佳","text":"劫后楼台簇簇新，天光一览净无垠。\n洛阳城里秋风起，如此江山思煞人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18089,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二月初三日为先母忌辰舟中感赋二首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"屈指慈颜隔，于今十五年。\n劬劳怀死后，奉养缺生前。\n兄弟谁劳力，妻孥转息肩。\n梁山风雨夜，惆怅抚琴弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18090,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二月初三日为先母忌辰舟中感赋二首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"梅蕊初开日，萱帷永诀辰。\n一官皆祖泽，七尺是亲身。\n姑息偏容我，饥寒特苦人。\n显扬图报称，此愿几时伸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18091,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泊舟清淮见某官舫","author":"张洵佳","text":"清淮渺渺指旌旗，簇拥楼船迅若驰。\n寄语锦帆莫高挂，转湾恐有逆风时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18092,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿瓠园赠何秋辇五首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"小住扬州杜牧之，瓠园十载寄相思。\n落花啼鸟春如此，尽是当年水部诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18093,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿瓠园赠何秋辇五首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"维扬三日此勾留，月影扶疏花影稠。\n名士园亭才子笔，一门风雅足千秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18094,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿瓠园赠何秋辇五首 其三","author":"张洵佳","text":"呕血文章哭当歌，一编风雨费吟哦。\n家声两字传忠孝，太傅遗碑堕泪多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18095,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿瓠园赠何秋辇五首 其四","author":"张洵佳","text":"子夜闻歌唤奈何，人间祇是别离多。\n西江明月团圆否，好看双星渡绛河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18096,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿瓠园赠何秋辇五首 其五","author":"张洵佳","text":"一官劳我事风尘，太息儒冠误此身。\n鸿爪天涯随处印，十年重与證良因。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"张洵佳","text":"征帆曲折指清淮，篷底明窗面面开。\n洛下春风吹欲到，江南明月载之来。\n蘼芜径畔波双桨，杨柳亭前酒一杯。\n何处楼头数声笛，吹将愁绪不堪裁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春风词","author":"张洵佳","text":"东风吹我到天涯，子规劝我早还家。\n天涯何处无芳草，子规声声啼不了。\n去岁良辰二月八，海上花红月色白。\n惜花香史好寻花，万紫千红到眼赊。\n春来春去花无主，花亦有情泪如雨。\n此时谁识惜花心，多谢青鸾递好音。\n西窗携手谈衷曲，银漏沈沈烬红烛。\n碧水春生连理枝，彩毫题就定情词。\n抽刀断丝丝不断，早把红丝繫一半。\n销魂最是别离天，迢递京华路万千。\n匆匆令节过端午，无人知道相思苦。\n楼头昨夜灯花开，一笑刘郎今又来。\n绿波双桨载之去，枝上黄莺唤不住。\n从此新人是故人，团圆三五證良因。\n日高锦帐翻身懒，此际深情深似海。\n谁知良会有穷期，又唱阳关怨别离。\n长亭短陌人何处，斜阳望断归时路。\n今日依然二月辰，劳劳车马悔风尘。\n渡头杨柳青如许，可怜少妇闺中处。\n行人路上祝平安，盼到鱼书细细看。\n今宵閒月青缸影，醒著不眠眠著醒。\n洛阳城里又秋风，电闪时光一霎中。\n桃叶桃叶心无苦，渡江我自来迎汝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过函谷关口号","author":"张洵佳","text":"两次破秦师，奇勋冠六国。\n长有信陵君，六国并不得。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五月初四日旅邸书怀四首录二 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"人生何苦恋微官，优孟登场一例看。\n照影寒灯同寂寞，举头明月枉团栾。\n饥来驱我贫而仕，壮不如人老更难。\n珠米桂薪原不易，惭愁无计住长安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五月初四日旅邸书怀四首录二 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"明朝佳节又端阳，愁里清宵细细长。\n金尽谁怜苏季子，花开空忆杜秋娘。\n灯陪人影光偏皎，诗入乡心韵带商。\n衾枕夜凉眠不稳，一钩新月隐来墙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偃师旅次题壁二首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"生长江南三十年，虽然贫贱也神仙。\n花飞草长春三月，买到黄金值几千。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偃师旅次题壁二首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"黄沙十丈路漫漫，异地浑将异域看。\n草草劳人归不得，昨宵有梦到江南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"张洵佳","text":"黑风怒挟飞沙吼，村墟黯惨黄昏后。\n炊烟断绝鸟无声，道旁死人忽张口。\n跛驴枵腹倒地僵，五丁鞭之亦不走。\n主仆相顾各吞声，阴森如入阎罗城。\n栖我无床居无屋，饮我无浆食无粟。\n强梁昏夜来攫人，仆夫相戒不敢哭。\n行行重行行，破屋一灯明。\n入门穷窘求投宿，炙乾马矢森如镞。\n穹庐郁勃走龙蛇，茅檐罅漏攒蝙蝠。\n泥浆糠秕供具陈，未吞先吐肠辘辘。\n局蹐中宵泪未乾，明朝又复跨征鞍。\n吁嗟乎，行路难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己卯八月文闱差次","author":"张洵佳","text":"谁是生花笔擅长，十年前事怕思量。\n名场黑漆三生梦，词客青衫两鬓霜。\n官吏有钱能造命，文章无福不生光。\n祗今留得閒身在，又见黄槐举子忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过虎牢关","author":"张洵佳","text":"黄土夹青天，杀马可填道。\n楚汉争雄处，常闻古鬼啸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过张子房墓","author":"张洵佳","text":"力士一击击不中，百二十斤椎何用。\n不为大勇为小勇，此时子房真梦梦。\n曲曲清漪下邳桥，夕阳古渡影迢迢。\n突遇老人冠不整，呼履履我默警醒。\n出书一编曰可读，用此足槛秦人鹿。\n奚取荆卿匕首渐离筑。\n君不见萧何下狱韩彭死，仙乎仙乎早知此。\n此去随我访赤松，孺子乃以功名终。\n迄今墓木依然在，行人来往经千载。\n河山郁郁气葱葱，此中倘有黄石公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"洛阳道中","author":"张洵佳","text":"扰扰中原逐鹿忙，古今都会战争场。\n关河锁钥严东洛，陵寝松楸隐北邙。\n三尺剑锋争胜负，一枰棋子算兴亡。\n行人欲问前朝事，春草青青掩夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望首阳山","author":"张洵佳","text":"首阳之山不甚高，并无悬崖峭壁干云霄。\n首阳之山不甚奇，亦无灵芝仙桂纷葳蕤。\n古来仁人志士矢节捐躯时，或有龙泉饮鸩酒。\n否则万仞之渊竟投身，否则三尺之组竟缳首。\n而乃伯夷叔齐特创一奇局，不入周廷裹其足。\n不食周粟枵其腹，采薇采薇歌一曲。\n颓然饿倒荒山麓，遂令首阳一山尊之埒嵩岳。\n乃知仁人志士所恃惟一死，死无一定惟其是。\n君臣之义无可逃，父母之身不可毁。\n空山槁饿两无伤，全受全归仍孝子。\n不然叩马谏东征，胡不即死左右兵，而使西山片石千古垂芳名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题熊露阶同年淩霄花双蝶画册二首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"丰姿雅淡骨嶙峋，妙绝丹青笔有神。\n种傍萱帏应更好，年年花发戴长春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题熊露阶同年淩霄花双蝶画册二首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"此较凡英迥不同，知君寄托在图中。\n他年应冠群芳谱，长沐东皇雨露浓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元夕偶成","author":"张洵佳","text":"故乡灯市异乡看，第一良宵梦广寒。\n怪道春风吹得早，本来明月易团栾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题郑州吴峻卿刺史扬州纪游诗集二首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"居然三月下扬州，一曲清平纪胜游。\n修到当年狂杜牧，此生端不羡封侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题郑州吴峻卿刺史扬州纪游诗集二首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"小金山下踏春行，一颗明珠掌上擎。\n清似梅花轻似柳，可怜飞燕不如卿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庚辰岁暮杂感示谢小渔孝廉四首 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"年来踪迹似飘蓬，旅舍光阴又岁终。\n牖户绸缪同命鸟，茶饴甘苦可怜虫。\n不工迎合终缘懒，尚爱诗书未送穷。\n欲待新春占鹊语，灯花先报隔年红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庚辰岁暮杂感示谢小渔孝廉四首 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"怀中匣剑掌中杯，壮志于今渐渐灰。\n捷足功名疑有线，出身蓬荜况无才。\n文章误我难争命，袍笏随人怕上台。\n好与君寻高士宅，一枝梅蕊迓春开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庚辰岁暮杂感示谢小渔孝廉四首 其三","author":"张洵佳","text":"长夜沉沉思百端，家书何处报平安。\n巢居蚊睫休嫌窄，梦绕牛衣幸耐寒。\n诗到和平可以怨，事非阅历不知难。\n美人嫁后风流减，错把当年玉面看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庚辰岁暮杂感示谢小渔孝廉四首 其四","author":"张洵佳","text":"骨爱梅花品爱莲，旧家小玉是神仙。\n相随宦海三千里，算买芳邻百万钱。\n风雅尽能传韵事，悲欢容易感中年。\n东山福分难希冀，聊把閒情付管弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"原韵再寄 其一","author":"张洵佳","text":"一般身世感萍蓬，旅邸联吟到岁终。\n名士大都成画饼，才人原不薄雕虫。\n仍无禖祝能占梦，尽有医经莫疗穷。\n多谢高情劳赠答，故人两地一灯红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"原韵再寄 其二","author":"张洵佳","text":"无聊长夜独衔杯，绛蜡烧残隔岁灰。\n似我平生多任运，怕他长吏要衡才。\n閒搜胜迹来梁苑，笑索诗逋上债台。\n薄宦三年尘俗甚，茅蹊何幸得君开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题诸衡伯湘中纪行稿","author":"张洵佳","text":"人生生落古人后，往往死出古人先。\n惟有郁勃恢奇之著作，乃与星斗日月相盘旋。\n卓哉弇州有诗伯，精诣直造青莲仙。\n吮笔哦诗数十载，忽然飞去苍梧之野九嶷巅。\n划然长啸秋空碧，仙心诗意同翩翩。\n有时淋漓酣醉写，胸臆浩然之气淩空直泻如奔泉。\n有时离别道悲愤，又如湘灵鼓瑟弦柱声呜咽。\n左携浮邱袖，右拍洪崖肩。\n不交今人交死友，独为老髯生日开琼筵。\n遍游衡岳来梁苑，示我一卷琳琅编。\n三湘七泽供吞吐，咀而味之令我流馋涎。\n信于此道肱三折，格调应在唐人前。\n愿书万本诵万遍，附君之诗寿世一千年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]